## Description

Long answers on Claude on web and desktop now stream ~4x smoother.  We rebuilt the streaming renderer to only touch what's still changing, so a long reply stalls 9x less on a slower laptop, its worst freeze is 4.5x shorter, and on a 120Hz MacBook it holds 120fps start to finish. https://t.co/huomk33lMb

